# Digest-relevant text must check out byte-identically on every platform.
#
# Table digests are taken over the raw CSV bytes (`01-ir.md` §2.9), goldens are
# compared byte for byte, and `.pir` canonical text is hashed into
# `model_digest` — so none of these files may be subject to eol conversion on
# checkout (e.g. `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows).
*.pir text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.golden text eol=lf
